OL,3,GNEWSA'I'll be thinking of dad at Albion
OL,4,Aplay premiere'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe director of a new play charting
OL,7,FBrighton & Hove Albion's journey from
OL,8,Flosing their home to European nights
OL,9,Fsays he will be thinking of his father
OL,10,Fwhen he performs it after sharing many
OL,11,Fof his footballing memories with him.
OL,13,FStand Or Fall - The Play, which will
OL,14,Fpremiere in September, follows a family
OL,15,Fof Albion supporters through their
OL,16,Fexperience of the club's near
OL,17,Fextinction to fighting in Europe.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
